#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:6
msgid "Building QET from source"
msgstr "从源头构建QET"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:8
msgid ""
"This section is for users and contributors wanting to build and/or improve "
"QElectroTech (QET)."
msgstr "本节为希望建立和(或)改进QElectroTech(QET)的用户和贡献者提供。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:10
msgid ""
"This guide assumes that you have forked the source repo and that your system"
" has the Git VCS (Version Control System) configured to point to that fork. "
"For installation instructions, please refer to the `Installing Git`_ "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"本指南假定您已经预留了源重播，您的系统配置了 Git VCS (Version Control System) 来指向叉。 对于安装指令，请参考 `安装"
" Git <Installing Git_>`_ 说明。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:14
msgid "Make sure to add Git to your ``PATH`` during the Windows installation."
msgstr "在Windows安装过程中确保将 Git 添加到您的 ``PATH`` 中。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you need help to setup Git or you are unsure about something regarding "
"pushing code to the repo, please have a look at the :doc:`Contributing "
"guidelines <contributing>`."
msgstr "如果你需要帮助设置吉特或者你不确定什么关于推进代码到repo, 请看一下 :doc:`贡献准则<contributing>`."

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:20
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:22
msgid "Get the sources and initialize the submodules by running this command"
msgstr "通过运行此命令获取源并初始化子模块"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:30 ../../source/developer/build.rst:133
#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:164
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:33
msgid "Native"
msgstr "原生环境"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:34
msgid ""
"For a Debian-like machine (Ubuntu, Linux Mint, etc), install the required "
"packages. These include QT 5 and KDE 5.15.X Dev headers and other utilities "
"like SQLite DB code utilities."
msgstr ""
"对于类似Debian的机器(Ubuntu,Linux Mint等),安装所需的软件包，其中包括QT 5和KDE 5.15.X Dev头和SQLite "
"DB 代码公用事业等其他公用事业。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:42
msgid "Containerized"
msgstr "容器化环境"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:44
msgid ""
"If you are worried about risks of dependency breakage, you can use a tool "
"like `Distrobox`_ to easily setup a contained environment. After creating "
"the box with your choice OS, follow the package install guidelines in the "
"\"Native\" part of the build docs."
msgstr ""
"如果您担心依赖中断的风险，您可以使用像 `Distrobox <Distrobox_>`_ 这样的工具来方便地设置一个包含的环境 。 在使用您选择的 "
"OS 创建框后，请在 building docs 的“ Native” 部分遵循软件包安装指南 。"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:47
msgid ""
"*Example of Debian box creation. Replace <name> with the one you want to "
"give to it.*"
msgstr "*Debian 框创建的示例。将 <name> 替换为您要给它的一个。*"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:55 ../../source/developer/build.rst:126
#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:161
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../source/developer/build.rst:59
msgid ""
"Due to the fact that Windows uses its own C compiler (MSVC) and doesn't ship"
" with a GCC version by default, the Prerequisites Step is a little bit more "
"involved than on Linux."
msgstr ""
"由于Windows使用自己的C编译器(MSVC),并且默认不会携带GCC版本发货，因此Prerequists Step比Linux上的参与度略高。"

